  "instagram_caption": "How craps works, in under a minute.\n\nOn the come out, 7 or 11 wins for the pass line and 2, 3 or 12 loses. Anything else is the point, and it has to come again before a 7. The pass line wins about 49.3% of the time at even money, a 1.41% house edge, and the loud bets in the middle are far worse.\n\nEducation only. Not gambling advice. 18+\n\nHad you ever worked out what was happening at a craps table?\n\n#theriggedgame #craps #howtoplay #casino #houseedge",
  "youtube_title": "How Craps Works In Under A Minute",
  "youtube_description": "Craps explained simply: the come out roll, the point, and why a seven ends it. The pass line wins about 49.3% of the time at even money, a 1.41% house edge, and a middle bet like any seven carries 16.67%.\n\nEducation only. Not gambling advice. 18+ AI narration.\n\nSources:\n• Encyclopaedia Britannica, \"Craps\"\n• HowStuffWorks (John Grochowski), \"How to Play Craps\"\n\nThe Rigged Game: how casinos really work. Instagram: @the_rigged_game\n\n#Casino #Craps #Shorts"
 },
